# Fresh NEWWORLD.ZEN. Authored NW_HARBOUR_BARREL_01, ZEN id 24244:
# origin (10248.6309, 326.437866, 2359.78076) cm. No prop is inserted or moved.
# Census: only landscape support, depth -0.443108 cm. With radius x1.5 the
# wall gap is 51.081 cm and the barrel remains movable. Approach/arrow come
# from +X, pushing toward -X and away from the wall; clearance checks each
# actual 200 cm line with native Jolt/visual rays. Camera faces the free side.
# Run originals (no meshes index), radius-scale 1, and radius-scale 1.5, each
# with MOVABLE_VOBS=0 and =1. Pass absolute replacement-content/output paths.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view nopfx
cam lift off
destruction off
sticking feature on
walkmode walk
own-mesh setup 24244 1 0
clear 1800
wait 500
own-mesh clearance
shot own-mesh-physics
wait 34
# A real native projectile is aimed at the authored half-height, with gravity.
own-mesh arrow
wait 700
# Return only the hero to the same straight approach. The body stays authored;
# its push reference is sampled after the shot and its initial settling.
# Forward steering holds this line against tangential facet sliding; the
# native character controller alone supplies positions and velocities.
own-mesh walk
wait 500
press forward
wait 2500
# Check while forward is still held: the last 500 ms distinguish stop/motion.
own-mesh checkpoint
release forward
wait 34
shot own-mesh-physics-contact
wait 34
census
